                "description": "Global TH1100-STED-PULL - This contemporary design offset door pull has 10 inch Center to Center mounting points with a total length of 11-1/8 inches. Most often used on metal framed glass commercial doors such as restaurant entry doors, storefront doors, office entry doors, etc. ",
